Package: himosoft-k3s-server
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: curl, ca-certificates
Maintainer: Himosoft <admin@himosoft.com.bd>
Description: Himosoft K3s Server — interactive K3s setup for Linux servers
 Installs the himosoft-k3s-server command for preparing Ubuntu/Debian
 servers as K3s nodes. Auto-detects public IP, prompts for domain
 and options, installs K3s with bundled Traefik disabled.
